&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;529&quot; data-local-id=&quot;65ae6d82-766f-471f-940b-ec0d6c9f0155&quot;&gt;The Contracts &amp;amp; Procurement Specialist is responsible for supporting commercial contracting and procurement execution across Oklo’s engineering, manufacturing, construction, operations, and corporate functions.&lt;/p&gt;
