&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2447&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8319028495a3&quot;&gt;Track supplier documentation, certifications, quality records, and contractual requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2542&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7128fc17a6c0&quot;&gt;Serve as a primary point of contact for internal stakeholders regarding procurement and contracting activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2656&quot; data-local-id=&quot;98acd2751a1d&quot;&gt;Coordinate with Engineering, Manufacturing, Construction, Operations, Quality, and Finance teams to support project execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
