&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ez3pml&quot; data-start=&quot;5058&quot; data-end=&quot;5129&quot;&gt;Willing to propose novel and creative solutions to technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1443goj&quot; data-start=&quot;5130&quot; data-end=&quot;5245&quot;&gt;An excellent writer who can write in modern active voice, so make your cover letter compelling and write it well!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fqrrgk&quot; data-start=&quot;5246&quot; data-end=&quot;5306&quot;&gt;Able to communicate technical content and results verbally&lt;/li&gt;
