&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with metallic fuels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with fuel analysis and fuel performance software (e.g., BISON, LIFE-METAL, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in material selection and material analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Python&lt;/li&gt;
