&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3152&quot;&gt;Advanced degree in engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
