&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3386&quot;&gt;Familiarity with NQA-1 test control requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3438&quot;&gt;Experience managing end-to-end test projects, including overseeing test procurement, coordinating cross-functional teams, and meeting stringent regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
