&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c6b2ccd6-5328-4f70-9b49-9ff06e136ca6&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1980&quot; data-local-id=&quot;59a78d922f9f&quot;&gt;Passionate about clean energy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
