&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2014&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9ac2e454f3b5&quot;&gt;Motivated by building, and getting technology deployed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2072&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9b529731b207&quot;&gt;Energized by tackling and overcoming challenges&lt;/p&gt;
