&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also think the following are good indicators of qualifications to do this job:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS in engineering from an accredited college or university, experience may qualify&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated coordination skills; ability to earn the trust of team members and management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven team player with excellent verbal, written communication/presentation, and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
