&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3375&quot;&gt;Experience with simulation tools (e.g., ANSYS, ROS, MATLAB/Simulink)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
