&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo!&amp;nbsp; We are searching for a Process Engineer to join our Fuel Recycling engineering team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The person in this role is responsible for conducting design, development, prototyping, and validation work on key chemical separation subsystems and supporting systems for Oklo’s fuel recycling facility. These subsystems may include pyroprocessing, off-gas separation, and waste immobilization. It will include collaboration with cross-functional teams including those with a focus on facility design, unit process equipment design, and licensing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;638&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dac19f068b98&quot;&gt;Developing systems that meet facility and regulatory requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;707&quot; data-local-id=&quot;055820fd8bdc&quot;&gt;Defining system and unit process requirements and validation methodologies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;785&quot; data-local-id=&quot;acd446d7e1e3&quot;&gt;Establishing performance criteria, test protocols, and prototyping equipment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;865&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d20b030e1518&quot;&gt;Developing technical parameters and deploying and operating test systems to use in refining system design and operation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;988&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dc02b51e5557&quot;&gt;Completing equipment sizing and specifications and developing instrument process data specifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1092&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ea5bbc7b86dc&quot;&gt;Developing process flow sheets and heat and material balances using process simulation tools&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1188&quot; data-local-id=&quot;06bbac01474b&quot;&gt;Developing and maintaining process and instrumentation diagrams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1255&quot; data-local-id=&quot;74f9dbd77dbb&quot;&gt;Generating documentation to guide the fabrication, installation, commissioning, operation, and maintenance of subsystems&lt;/p&gt;
