&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1383&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d5ed085e-09b0-470e-8870-54883f0eb18d&quot;&gt;Execute competitive sourcing events, including RFQ/RFP development, bid leveling, commercial analysis, supplier evaluation, and supplier selection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1534&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7e970d3155f9&quot;&gt;Create, review, and administer purchase orders in alignment with negotiated commercial terms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1631&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f15c47f6248a&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Fuel Recycling engineering and project teams to understand technical requirements, schedules, risks, and supplier capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1783&quot; data-local-id=&quot;876e37629aa3&quot;&gt;Source materials, equipment, fabrication services, construction-related services, and other program-critical requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1908&quot; data-local-id=&quot;46ea5081bdc6&quot;&gt;Support contract development, commercial negotiations, and procurement activities under the guidance of the Senior Manager of Contract Procurement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2059&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c7bf5de49782&quot;&gt;Assist with procurement and commercial activities associated with construction, facility, infrastructure, and capital project execution as needed.&lt;/p&gt;
