&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1061&quot;&gt;Research and interpret regulations and regulatory precedents&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1125&quot;&gt;Generate, refine, and review licensing documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1183&quot;&gt;Support managing deliverables for a variety of internal and external regulatory activities&lt;/p&gt;
