&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo!&amp;nbsp; We are searching for a Senior Electrical Engineer to join our team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;148&quot; data-local-id=&quot;65ae6d82-766f-471f-940b-ec0d6c9f0155&quot;&gt;In this role, you will own the design, development, integration, and validation of electrical systems supporting a nuclear fuel recycling facility. These systems include facility power distribution, electrical infrastructure, equipment power systems, and interfaces with process and control systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;449&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1f8d11bf0428&quot;&gt;This is a first-of-a-kind (FOAK) facility, and this role requires ownership across the full lifecycle from early concept development through detailed design, construction, commissioning, and operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;653&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e6b407d2f64b&quot;&gt;This role includes close collaboration with cross-functional teams focused on facility design, process engineering, controls engineering, equipment design, and licensing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;869&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b35db668ea89&quot;&gt;Lead the design and implementation of facility electrical systems from concept through commissioning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;973&quot; data-local-id=&quot;566767332fc7&quot;&gt;Design and specify high-, medium-, and low-voltage power distribution systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1054&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0935a602652e&quot;&gt;Define system architecture, including redundancy, backup power, and safety strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1143&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a9e73f99df1&quot;&gt;Perform and review power system studies (load flow, short-circuit, coordination)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1227&quot; data-local-id=&quot;19c5914dea99&quot;&gt;Generate and review electrical documentation (single-line diagrams, load lists, specifications, cable schedules)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1343&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f451ca74f05d&quot;&gt;Lead integration with control systems (PLC/DCS/HMI)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1398&quot; data-local-id=&quot;318ff91c7a47&quot;&gt;Develop grounding, bonding, and lightning protection strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1465&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3b38dac708a6&quot;&gt;Support procurement, installation, and commissioning activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1532&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e3c8c58fbce6&quot;&gt;Collaborate on facility layout, constructability, and maintainability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1605&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c87947ef3257&quot;&gt;Generate technical documentation supporting regulatory and licensing efforts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1685&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e9eba31fd40e&quot;&gt;Serve as the electrical technical lead across lifecycle stages&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
