&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1780&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8232b35ce536&quot;&gt;Degree in Electrical Engineering or related field&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1833&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3402d08b8cb5&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience designing and deploying industrial or facility-scale electrical systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1932&quot; data-local-id=&quot;131e580c406d&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ownership of electrical system design through multiple project phases (concept through commissioning)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
