&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;736&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;In this role you might:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;897&quot;&gt;Transform and optimize the storage of reactor data and physics results&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;897&quot;&gt;Design and configure CI/CD pipelines to perform multiphysics analyses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1044&quot;&gt;Build tools for reactor engineers to visualize, compare, and evaluate reactor designs and their physics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1151&quot;&gt;Integrate simulation tools into our analyses pipelines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1209&quot;&gt;Implement physics kernels to solve unanswered problems, or to improve performance of existing models&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1313&quot;&gt;Develop high-level reactor optimization schemes and statistical experiments to inform design changes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;Identify and improve process-related inefficiencies in reactor design that can be addressed with software&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
