&lt;li&gt;Willing to propose novel and creative solutions to technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent writer who can write in modern active voice, so make your cover letter compelling and write it well!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment and decision-making in radiological and operational environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
