&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo!&amp;nbsp; We are searching for a &lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#bf2600&quot;&gt;Sr. Manager, Direct Procurement (Hardware) &lt;/span&gt;to join our Procurement &amp;amp; Supply Chain organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;546&quot; data-local-id=&quot;65ae6d82-766f-471f-940b-ec0d6c9f0155&quot;&gt;The &lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#bf2600&quot;&gt;Sr. Manager, Direct Procurement (Hardware) &lt;/span&gt;is responsible for developing and executing sourcing, supplier management, and procurement strategies for hardware systems critical to Oklo’s products and programs. This role leads procurement activities for complex components, assemblies, equipment, manufacturing systems, and integrated hardware solutions supporting Aurora powerhouses, fuel recycling systems, fuel fabrication capabilities, and future Oklo technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1018&quot; data-local-id=&quot;583891c65bd1&quot;&gt;This role is responsible for leading a growing team of procurement professionals, developing strategic supplier relationships, negotiating complex commercial agreements, and ensuring suppliers can meet Oklo’s cost, quality, schedule, and capacity requirements. The Senior Manager partners closely with Engineering, Manufacturing, Quality, Legal, and Program Management to support the successful development and deployment of Oklo’s products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1461&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4b6971c04682&quot;&gt;This role focuses on procurement of Oklo-designed hardware systems and equipment and is distinct from procurement activities related to EPC, construction, and professional services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1688&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e715008548b4&quot;&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop a growing team of procurement professionals responsible for direct hardware sourcing and supplier management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1826&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c3c06bf6e1fc&quot;&gt;Develop and execute procurement strategies for complex hardware systems, equipment, components, and assemblies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1940&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d3346a05b9d0&quot;&gt;Support procurement activities across Aurora powerhouses, fuel recycling systems, fuel fabrication capabilities, and future Oklo technologies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2085&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f18615a5d7fb&quot;&gt;Establish and manage competitive sourcing processes, including RFQs, RFPs, supplier evaluations, and supplier selection activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2219&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ac3f5d2c747b&quot;&gt;Lead commercial negotiations for strategic supplier agreements and long-term supply partnerships&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2319&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6b134a0ea6ad&quot;&gt;Develop and manage supplier relationships to support quality, delivery, capacity, and cost objectives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2424&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5924f4fdeff5&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Engineering teams to align sourcing strategies with product requirements, technical specifications, and development schedules&lt;/p&gt;
